hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1936","Abdur-Rehman bin Aswad ne apne walid Aswad se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : 2 namazein hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere ghar mein unhein raazdari se aur elaniya kabhi tark nahi kya : 2 rakatein fajr se pahley aur 2 rakatein Asr ke baad."
"1937","Abu-Ishaq ne Aswad aur Masruq se riwayat ki, un donon ne kaha : ham Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke barey mein gawahi detey hain ke unhon-ne kaha : koi din jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas hotey they aisa na tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye 2 rakatein na padhi hun. unki murad Asr ke baad ki 2 rakaton se thi."
"1938","Mukhtar-bin-fulful se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se Asr ke baad nafl Namaz padhney ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Asr ke baad Namaz padhney par hathon par maartey they aur Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daur mein ham suraj ke ghurub ho janey ke baad namaze-Maghrib se pahley 2 rakatein padhtey they. to maine unse puchha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye 2 rakatein padhein? unhon-ne kaha : aap hamein padhta dekhtey they aap ne na hamein hukm diya aur na roka."
"1939","Abdul-Azeez bin Suheb ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Madiney mein hotey they, jab muazzan maghrib ki azan deta to log sutunon ki taraf lapaktey they aur wo 2 rakatein padhtey they yahan tak ke aik musaafir masjid mein aata to un rakaton ko padhney walon ki kasarat dekh kar ye samajhta ke maghrib ki Namaz ho chuki hai."
"1940","Kahmas ne kaha : ham se Abdullah-bin Barida ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Mughaffal Muzni (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har 2 azaanon ( azan aur takbeer (ke darmyan Namaz hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen baar farmaya (aur ( teesri baar farmaya : uske liye jo chaahey."
"1941","Jurairi ne Abdullah-bin Barira se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki misl riwayat ki, magar unhon-ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chothi martaba farmaya : uske liye jo chaahey."
"1942","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaze-khof padhai, 2 girohon mein se aik ko aik rakaat padhai aur doosra giroh dushman ke samney khada hua tha, phir ye (aap ke sath Namaz padhney waale) palat gaey aur apne sathiyon ki jagah dushman ki taraf rukh karke ja khadey huey aur wo log aa gaey. phir Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bhi aik rakaat padhai aur uske baad Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam pher diya phir (aap ke baad) unhon-ne bhi apni rakaat mukammal kar li aur unhon-ne bhi dusri rakaat mukammal kar li."
"1943","Fulaih ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim bin-Abdullah-bin umr se aur unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Salatul-khauf (ka tariqa ( bayan kartey aur farmatey : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ye Namaz padhi. padhi. ( aagey ( usi ke ham mana hadis hai."
"1944","Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne jang ke dinon mein se aik din Namaz khof padhai, aik giroh Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz ke liye khada ho gaya aur doosra dushman ke bilmuqabil. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sath khadey honey walon ko aik rakat padha di, phir ye log ( dushman ke muqaabley mein) chaley gaey aur doosrey aa gaey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bhi aik rakaat padha di, phir un donon girohon ne ( yakey baad doosrey ( eik-eik rakaat ada kar li. ( Naafe ( ne kaha : ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : agar khof us se zyada ho (aur saf bandi mumkin na ho ( to sawari par ya khadey khadey ishara karo aur Namaz padh lo."
"1945","Ata ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath namaze-khof mein Sharik hua, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamari 2 safain banaain, aik saf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey thi (aur dusri unke peechhey (aur dushman hamarey aur qibley ke darmyan tha, Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne takbeer ( tahreema ( kahi aur ham sab ne bhi takbeer kahi , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo kya aur ham sab ne rukoo kya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo se apna sar uthaya aur ham sab ne sar uthaya , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey ke liye jhuk gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se muttasil saf ne bhi sajda kya aur pichhli saf dushman ke madde-muqabil khadi rahi, jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 sajdey kar liye aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se muttasil saf ( sajdey karke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saath) khadi ho gaee to pichhli saf sajdey ke liye nichey hui aur phir khadi ho gaee, iske baad pichhli saf aagey aa gaee aur agli saf peechhey chali gaee, phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo kya to ham sab ne rukoo kya. phir aap ne rukoo se apna sar uthaya aur ham sab ne bhi sar uthaya , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se muttasil saf jo pehli rakaat mein peechhey thi, sajdey ke liye nichey chali gaee aur pichhli saf dushman ke muqaabley mein khadi rahi , jab Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se muttasil saf ne sajda kar liya to pichhli saf sajdey ke liye jhukii . unhon-ne sajdey kiye. phir Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera aur ham sab ne bhi salam pher diya. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya : jis tarah tumharey muhaafiz ( aajkal ( apne ameeron ki hifazat ke liye kartey hain."
"1946","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath juhaina qabeeley ke logon se jang ladi, unhon-ne hamarey sath badi shadeed jang ki jab ham ne Zohar ki Namaz padhi to mushrikon ne kaha : agar ham un par yakbaargi hamla karein to unko kaat kar rakh dein. Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is baat se aagah kar diya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein bataya . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : un logon ne kaha hai ke abhi unki aik aisi Namaz ka waqt aaney wala hai jo unko unki aulad se bhi zyada pyari hai. jab Asr ka waqt aaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamari 2 safain banaain jabke mushrik hamarey aur hamarey qibley ke darmyan they. kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne takbeer tahreema kahi aur ham ne bhi takbeer kahi , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo kya aur ham ne bhi rukoo kya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sajda kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath pehli saf ne bhi sajda kya. jab ye hazraat khadey ho gaey to dusri saf walon ne sajdey kiye, phir pehli saf peechhey chali gaee aur dusri aagey badh gaee aur pehli saf ki jagah khadi ho gaee. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne takbeer kahi aur ham ne bhi takbeer kahi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo kya aur ham ne bhi rukoo kya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sajda kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ( maujooda ( pehli saf ne sajda kya aur dusri khadi rahi. phir jab dusri saf ne sajdey kar liye aur uske baad sab baith gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sab ke sath salam phera . abu-Zubair ne kaha : phir Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne khususi taur par farmaya : jis tarah tumharey ye ameer Namaz padhtey hain."
"1947","Abdur-Rehman bin-Qasim ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Saleh bin Khawwaat bin Juber se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Sehal-bin-abi-Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sathiyon ko Namaz khof padhai aur unhein apne peechhey 2 safon mein khada kya aur apne sath (ki saf ( walon ko aik rakaat padhai. phir aap khadey ho gaey aur khadey hi rahe yahan tak ke unse peechhey walon ne aik rakaat padh li, phir ye aagey aagey aur jo unse aagey they peechhey chaley gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein aik rakaat padhai. phir aap baith gaey yahan tak ke jo peechhey chaley gaey they unhon-ne ( bhi aik aur) rakaat padh li, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera ."
"1948","Yazeed bin Ruman ne Saleh bin khawwat se aur unhon-ne us shakhs se naql kya jisne jang zaatur-Riqaa mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath namaaze-khauf padhi thi. ke aik giroh ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath saf banai aur doosra giroh dushman ke ru-baru tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sath walon ko aik rakaat padhai, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey rahe aur unhon-ne apne taur par (doosri rakaat padh kar) Namaz mukammal kar li aur) salam pher kar) chaley gaey aur dushman ke samney saf band ho gaey aur doosra giroh aa gaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo rakaat rehti thi, unko padha di phir baithey rahe aur un logon ne apne taur par) rakaat padh kar) Namaz mukammal kar li to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sath salam phera ."
"1949","Aban bin Yazeed ne kaha : ham se Yahya ibne- Kasir ne abu-Salma (bin Abdur-Rehman ( se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (jihad par) aaey. yahan tak ke jab ham (zaatur-Riqaa) (naam ke pahaad) tak pahunchey. kaha : hamari aadat thi ke jab ham kisi ghaney saaey waley darakht tak pahunchtey to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye chhod detey, kaha : aik mushrik aaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki talwaar darakht par latki hui thi, us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki talwaar pakad li, usey miyan se nikala aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kehney laga : kya aap mujh se dartey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi. usne kaha : to phir aapko mujh se kon bachaaeyga? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala mujhey tum se mehfooz farmaeyga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathiyon ne usey dhamkaya to usne talwaar miyaan mein daal li aur usey latkaaya. iske baad Namaz ke liye azan kahi gaee, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik giroh ko 2 rakaat Namaz padhai , phir wo giroh peechhey chala gaya iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doosrey giroh ko 2 rakatein padhaain. kaha is tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki char rakatein huin aur logon ki 2-2 rakatein."
"1950","Muawiya bin Salam ne kaha : mujhey Yahya (bin-abi-kasir) ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne khabar di ke unhein Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath namaze-khof padhi, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik giroh ko do rakatein padhaain, phir doosrey giroh ko 2 rakatein padhaain, is tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char rakatein padhein aur har giroh ko 2-2 rakatein padhaain."
"1951","Naafe ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : jab tum mein se koi shakhs Jumey ke liye aaney ka irada karey to wo ghusl kare."
"1952","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Abdullah bin-Abdullah-bin Umer se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne member par khadey huey farmaya : tum mein se jo Jumey ke liye aaey ghusl kare."
"1953","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : ibne-Shahab ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke donon beton Salim aur Abdullah se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us (pichhli hadis) ke maaninde-riwaayat ki."
"1954","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Salim bin-Abdullah se aur unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna. padhi. ( aagey ( usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah hai."
"1955","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Jumey ke din logon ko khitab farma rahe they (ke isi beech mein) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) mein se aik shakhs dakhil hua, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein awaz di : ( aaney ki) ye kon si ghadi hai? unhon-ne kaha : main aaj masroof ho gaya, ghar lauttey hi maine azan suni aur sirf wuzu kya (aur hazir ho gaya hon (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aur wo bhi) sirf ( wuzu ? halanke aapko malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl karne ka hukm detey they."
"1956","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : (eik baar (Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Jumey ke din logon ko khutba irshad farma rahe they ke usi doran mein Hazrat Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) masjid mein dakhil huey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne un par aetraz kya aur kaha : logon ko kya hua ke azan ke baad der lagaatey hain? Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aey ameerul-momeneen ! maine azan sunney par us se zyada kuchh nahi kya ke wuzu kya hai aur hazir ho gaya hun, is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur wo bhi) sirf ( wuzu ? kya tum logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey nahi suna : jab tum mein se koi Jumey ke liye aaey to wo ghusl karey?"
"1957","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Jumey ke din har baligh shakhs par ghusl karna wajib hai."
"1958","Urwa-bin-Zubair ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Jumey ke liye log apne gharon se aur awali se baari-baari aatey they wo ooni abaaein pahney hotey they aur (rastey mein) un par gardo-ghubar bhi padta tha jiski wjah se unse bu phootti thi unmein se aik insan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif farma they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya hi achchha ho ke tum log us din ke liye saaf suthrey ho jaya karo."
"1959","Umra ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : log kaam-kaaj waley they unke naukar-chaakar na hotey they wo aisey they ke unse bu aati thi to unse kaha gaya : kya hi achchha ho ke tum Jumey ke din naha liya karo."
"2044","Hasan-bin- Muslim ne Taaus se khabar di unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha : main eidul-fitr ki Namaz mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam), Abu-Bakar , umr aur Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath hazir hua hun. ye sab khutbey se pahley Namaz padhtey they phir khutba detey they aik baar Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( buland jagah se) nichey aaey aisa mehsus hota hai ke main ( ab bhi) aapko dekh raha hun jab aap apne hath se mardon ko bitha rahe they phir unke darmyan mein se rasta banatey huey aagey badhey yahan tak ke aurton ke qareeb tashrif ley aaey aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke sath they aap ne ( Quran ka ye hissey tilawat ( farmaya; ''aey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! jab aap ke paas momin auratein is baat par bait karne ke liye aaein ke wo Allah Taala ke sath kisi cheez ko Sharik nahi banaygii.'' aap ne ye aayat tilawat farmai yahan tak ke is se farigh huey phir farmaya, tum is par qaaim ho? to aik aurat ne ( jabke ( aapko iske ilawa unmein se aur kisi ne jawab nahi diya kaha : haan aey Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) !.  us waqt pata nahi chal raha tha ke wo kon hai? aap ne farmaya, tum sadqa karo.  is par Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna kapda phaila diya phir kehney lagey lao tum sab par mere maan-baap qurbaan hon ! to wo apne badey-badey chhalley aur anguthiyan Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey mein dalney lageii."
"2047","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : hamein Ata ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di kaha : maine un ( Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu)) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-fitr ke din (namaz ke liye) khadey huey phir Namaz padhai chunanche aap ne khutbey se pahley Namaz se shuruaat ki phir logon ko khitab farmaya. jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( khutbe se) farigh huey to ( chabootrey se) utar kar aurton ke paas aaey unhein tazkeer w nasihat ki jabke aap Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke bazu ka sahara liye huey they aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) apna kapda phailaey huey they auratein usmein sadqa daal rahi thin. (ibne-Juraij ne kaha : ( maine Ata se puchha fitr ke din ka sadqa ( daal rahi thin ? ( unhon-ne kaha : nahi us waqt ( apna ( sadqa kar rahi thin (koii aurat chhallaa dalti thi (isi tarah eik baad eik doosri) daal rahi thin aur daal rahi thin. maine Ata se ( phir ( puchha : kya ab bhi imam ke liye lazim hai ke jab ( mardon ke khutbey se) farigh ho to aurton ko talqeen aur nasihat karey? unhon-ne kaha : haan mujhey apni zindagi ki qism ! ye un par) Aaiz shuda ( haq hai unhein kya ho gaya hai ke wo aisa nahi kartey."
"2048","abdul-Malik-bin-abi Sulaiman ne Ata se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha : main eid ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz mein hazir hua aap ne khutbey se pahley azan aur takbeer ke baghair Namaz se shuruaat ki phir Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ka sahara lekar khadey huey Allah ke taqwa ka hukm diya uski itaat par ubhaaraa logon ko nasihat ki aur unhein ( Deen ki buniyadi baton ki) yad dahaanii karaai phir chal padey yahan tak ke aurton ke paas aagey (to ( unhein waz (nasihat) w talqeen ( tazkeer ( ki aur farmaya: sadqa karo kyonke tum mein se aksar jahannam ka iindhan hain. aurton ke darmyan se aik bhalii siyaahii maail rukhsaaron wali aurat ne khadey ho kar puchha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! kyon ? aap ne farmaya : isliye ke tum shikayat bahut karti ho aur apne rafeeq zindagi ki na-shukri karti ho. ( Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha is par wo auratein apne zewaraat se sadqa karne lagiin wo Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey main apni baaliyaan aur anguthiyan dalney lagiin ."
"2049","saiyedna Ibne-Abbas aur saiyedna Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke azan na eidul-fitr mein hoti thi aur na eidul-azha mein. phir maine unse puchha thodi der ke baad isi baat ko. (ye qaul hai ibne-Juraij rawi ka ( to unhon-ne kaha (yani unke Shekh ata ne) ke khabar di mujhey saiyedna Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke na azan hoti thi eidul-fitr mein jab imam nikalta tha aur na baad iske nikalney ke aur na takbeer hoti, na azan aur na aur kuchh wo din aisa hai ke us din na azan hai na takbeer ."
"2050","Muhammad-bin-Raafe ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Razzaq ne hadis sunai kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di kaha : mujhey Ata ne khabar di ke ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ki bait ke shuruat hi mein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unki taraf paigham bheja ke eidul-fitr ke din Namaz ( eid (ke liye azan nahi di jati thi lihaza aap uske liye azan na kahalwaaein ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne us din azan na kahlwaaii aur uske sath ye paigham bhi bheja ke khutba Namaz ke baad hai aur) ahade-nabawii aur khilafate raashida mein) aisey hi kya jata tha ( ata ne) kaha : to ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz khutbey se pahley padhai."
"2051","Hazrat Jaabir bin Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon-ne kaha maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath eidein ki Namaz aik ya 2 baar padhi hai."
"2052","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) eidein ki Namaz khutbey se pahley padhtey they."
"2053","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-azha aur eidul-fitr ke din tashrif latey to Namaz se shuruat farmatey aur jab apni Namaz padh letey aur salam phertey to khadey ho jatey logon ki taraf rukh farmatey jabke log apni Namaz padhney ki jagah mein baithey hotey, agar aapko koi lashkar bhejney ki zarurat hoti to uska logon ke samney zikr farmatey aur agar aapko iske siwa koi aur zarurat hoti to unhein iska hukm detey aur farmaya kartey sadqa karo sadqa karo sadqa karo zyada sadqa auratein diya karti thin phir aap wapas ho jatey aur yahi mamool (routine) chalta raha yahan tak ke Marwaan-bin-Hakam ka daur aa gaya mein iske sath hath mein hath daal kar nikla yahan tak ke ham eidgaah mein pahunch gaey to dekha ke Kasir bin Salat ne wahan mitti (ke gaarey (aur enton se member banaya hua tha to achcha Marwan ka hath mujh se khincha tani karne laga jaisey wo mujhey member ki taraf kheench raha ho aur main usey Namaz ki taraf kheench raha hun jab maine uski taraf se ye baat dekhi to maine kaha : Namaz se shuruat (ka masnoon tariqa) kahan hai? usne kaha : aey abu-Saeed ! jo aap jantey hain usey tark kar diya gaya hai maine kaha : hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! jo main janta hun tum us se behtar tariqa nahi la saktey. padhi. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne teen baar kaha, phir chal diye."
"2054","Muhammad (bin Sirin ( ne Hazrat umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aap ne hamein hukm diya. unki murad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se thi. padhi. ke ham dono eidon mein baligha aur parda-nasheen aurton ko ley jaya karein aur aap ne haiz wali aurton ko hukm diya ke wo musalmanon ki Namaz ki jagah se hat kar baithein."
"2055","Aasim ahwal ne Hafsa binte- Sirin se aur unhon-ne Hazrat umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein dono eidon mein nikalney ka hukm diya jata tha, parda nasheen aur do-sheeza ko bhi. unhon-ne kaha : haiz wali auratein bhi niklengi aur logon ke peechhey rahengi aur logon ke sath takbeer kahengi."
"2056","Hisham ne Hafsa bin Sirin se aur unhon-ne Hazrat umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham eidul-fitr aur eidul-azha mein aurton ko bahar nikalein, dosheeza, haaiza aur parda nashini aurton ko bahar nikalein, lekin haaiza Namaz se door rahen. wo khair w barkat aur musalmanon ki dua mein Sharik hon. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! ham mein se kisi aurat ke paas chadar nahi hoti . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : uski (koi musalman) behan usko apni chadar ka aik hissey pehna de."
"2059","Malik ne zamra bin Saeed Mazni se aur unhon-ne Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah se riwayat ki ke Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne abu Waqid Lesi (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-azha aur eidul-fitr mein kon si sura qirat farmatey they? to unhon-ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un donon mein sura ( ق وَالْقُرْ‌آنِ الْمَجِيدِ (aur sura ( اقْتَرَ‌بَتِ السَّاعَةُ وَانشَقَّ الْقَمَرُ‌ ( padha kartey they."
"2060","Fulaih ne zamra bin Saeed se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu Waqid Lesi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne farmaya, Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se us barey mein puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eid ki Namaz mein kya padha ? to maine kaha : ( اقْتَرَ‌بَتِ السَّاعَةُ (aur ( ق وَالْقُرْ‌آنِ الْمَجِيدِ ( ."
"2061","abu-Usama ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid ( Urwa ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) mere yahan tashrif laey jabke mere paas Ansar ki 2 bachchiyan thin aur Ansar ne jang Buaas mein jo ashaar aik doosrey ke muqaabley mein kahey they, unhein gaa rahi thin. kaha : wo koi gaaney waaliyaan na thin. Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne (unhein dekh kar) kaha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar mein shaitan ki awaz ( buland ho rahi ( hai? aur ye eid ke din hua tha. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abu-Bakar ! har qaum ke liye aik eid hai aur ye hamari eid hai."
"2062","abu-Muawiya ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath (pichhli hadis ki tarah ( riwayat ki aur is mein hai 2 bachchiyaan daf se khel rahi thin ( daf baja rahi thin)"
"2063","Amr ne kaha ke ibne-Shahab ne unhein Urwa se hadis sunai aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki (unhon-ne kaha (ke Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) mere yahan tashrif laey jabke Mina ke dinon mein mere paas 2 bachchiyan gaa rahi thin aur daf bajaa rahi thin aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kapda odhey letey huey they, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne un donon ko daantaa . is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne aap se kapda hataya aur farmaya : Abu-Bakar! unhein chhodiye ke ye eid ke din hain. aur) Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap mujhey apni chadar se chhipaaey huey they aur main habshiyon ko dekh rahi thi ke wo khel rahe they aur main kam umr ladki thi, zara andaza lagaao us ladki ka shauq kis qadr hoga jo khel ki shauqeen, nau (9) umr thi (wo kitni der khel dekhegi?)"
"2064","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se aur unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere hujrey ke darwazey par khadey hain aur habshi apne chhotey nezon ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid mein khel ( mashaqqatein kar) rahe they. aur aap mujhey apni chadar se chhipaaey huey hain taake main unke kartab dekh sakun, phir aap meri khaatir khadey rahe yahan tak ke main hi hun jo wapas palti, andaza karo aik nai umr ki ladki ka shauq kis qadr hoga jo khel ki shauqeen ho ( kitni der tak khadi rahi hogi. ("
"2065","Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman ne Urwa se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( ghar mein) dakhil huey jabke mere paas 2 bachchiyaan jang Buaas ke ashaar buland awaz se suna rahi thin. aap bistar par let gaey aur apna chehra (doosri samt ( pher liya. iske baad Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey. to unhon-ne mujhey sarzanish ki aur kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mojudgi mein shaitan ki awaz? is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur Farmaya : unhein chhodiye jab un (Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu)) ki tawajjoh hati to maine unko ishara kya aur wo chali gain aur Eid ka aik din tha, kaley log dhalon aur bhalon ke kartab dikha rahe they, to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhast ki ya aap ne khud hi farmaya : dekhney ki khahish rakhti ho? maine kaha : ji haan. aap ne mujhey apne peechhey khada kar liya, mera rukhsar aap ke rukhsar par (lag raha) tha aur aap farma rahe they : aey arfada ke beto! (apna muzahira) jari rakho. yahan tak ke jab main uktaa gaee (to (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey liye kafi hai? maine kaha : ji haan. farmaya : to chali jao."
"2066","Jarir ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid ( Urwa ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : habshi aa kar eid ke din masjid mein hathiyaaron ke sath uchhal kood rahe they, ( hathiyaron ka muzaahira kar rahe they) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bulaya , maine apna sar aap ke kandhey par rakha aur unka khel ( kartab ( dekhney lagi (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey rahe ( yahan tak ke maine khud hi unke khel ke nazaarey se wapsi ikhtiyar ki."
"2067","Yahya bin Zakariya-bin abi Zayda aur Muhammad-bin-Bishr donon ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath (pichhli hadis ki tarah) riwayat ki aur unhon-ne ( في المسجد ( (masjid mein) ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"2068","Ata ne bataya ke mujhey Ubaid-bin-Umair ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di ke unhon-ne khelney walon ke barey mein kaha : main unka khel dekhnaa chahti hun. kaha : is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey ho gaey aur main darwazey par khadi ho kar aap ke kanon aur kandhon ke darmyan se dekhney lagi aur wo log masjid mein khel rahe they. Ata ne kaha : wo Irani they ya habshi aur kaha : mujhey ibne-Atiq yani Ubaid-bin-Umair ne bataya ke wo habshi they."
"2069","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : jabke habshi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney apne bhaalon se khel rahe they, to Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) pahunch gaey aur kankariyaan uthaney ke liye jhukey taake wo unhein kankariyaan maarein to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : umr ! unhein chhod do."